  "title": "Cedar Planked Salmon",
  "description": "Cedar plank salmon is a delicious way to cook salmon for moist results with a delicious smoky flavor. This recipe uses a quick soy and ginger marinade.",
  "authors": [
    "Wendy Freeman-More"
  ],
  "date_published": "2006-07-08T18:36:58-04:00",
